-- The starting vehicle brands and models (STARTING_VEHICLE_BRANDS in @apc/domain/vehicle-lists) join the Catalog,
-- each with an empty tree. A brand the Catalog has already keeps its place and its tree; the others go at the end of
-- the rail in the list's order, with their letters (brandMark), and a brand's models go after the ones it has, in the
-- list's order. Only the brands and models the lists hold are made catalog entries, so nothing is added to or renamed
-- in the lists; running this on a catalog that has them all changes nothing.

